Z||000000||Racer 1||08-30-99||03:43 PM||||Man im telling you all right now this sticker stuff is getting outa hand here in New Mexico. I was going down the local strip when I saw a 98' Ford mustang with a Big white windshield sticker with japan-eezz writting on in. I thought to myself what a dumb*** ... And almost all the import cars here have these stickers also.Even if the car looks like crap. I was gonna put a BIG sticker saying "Made in AMERICA" or "No Jap Crap" lol even though I do drive a import lol. Man ill start stopping these people on the strip and start taking pics to post here.
