Z||000007||DXR_WILL||08-31-99||09:18 PM||||Maybe it's just me but I highly doubt that people put stickers on their car's because they think it adds horsepower.  Anywayz, since were on the subject of stickers, my dad and I just got back from the store and we saw a Chrysler Sebring with a big A$$ identity crisis.  It had a "TRD" sticker on the back window, which stands for Toyota Racing Developement and a bunch of DOHC V-TECH stickers on the side.  Also it had a bunch of  other stickers randomly placed on the car.
