Z||000009||DaRkLoRD||08-31-99||11:07 PM||||ROTFL..<p>that site is hilarious.. there are a few cars like that around here, such as a red Honda CRX that's so low it's almost scraping the ground, a 4" exhaist, tinted windows, etc.. but that's not as bad as some of the domestic cars I've seen.. one was a Corsica.. bright purple, with pink trim.. super dark tinted windows, big tires/wheels, a thumping stereo (nothing wrong with that however, I like bass!) and steret stickers slapped all over the car... looked ridiculous..<br>Speaking of stickers, I don't think 140hp is enough. I'm gonna go put some "powered by ford" stickers all over my mom's taurus, that ought to be good for another 20hp at least.. or does this strange effect only work on import cars? <IMG SRC="/ubb/wink.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15>
